{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">大熊貓「平平」和「福雙」凌晨由四川啟程前往美國。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">運送平平和福雙的專車，昨日深夜從成都的大熊貓繁育研究基地出發，大批工作人員歡送牠們，專車去機場沿途有警車開路，基地已為牠們預先準備好食物及應急藥物。大熊貓抵達雙流機場後，再被轉移到包機，凌晨2時55分起飛，啟程到亞特蘭大動物園。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.PANDA 1200.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026VJpESOuaR01790483811.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.PANDA 1200.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">為確保大熊貓，航程期間的安全與舒適，牠們早前已完成相關的適應性訓練。同為6歲的雄性大熊貓平平和雌性大熊貓福雙，會在美國展開10年長居生活。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.PANDA 1200_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026jIiNXRCh8B1790483851.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.PANDA 1200_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-27T04:58:15.208704+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}